{"unit_id":"AnacondaKC__dsh-custom-css#feature-theme-editor","repo":"AnacondaKC/dsh-custom-css","commit":"d1e2ee86b223775947eb5e26c62291a45df2fdcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-css 的功能「编辑并应用 CSS」：在 Web 设置页粘贴或编辑样式，修改后自动保存到宿主；已提交的 CSS 会注入页面的 style 标签，用户也可关闭样式开关。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/ThemeSection.tsx:121-138","src/client/index.ts:63-75"]}
