{"unit_id":"AnacondaKC__dsh-custom-css#feature-drafts","repo":"AnacondaKC/dsh-custom-css","commit":"d1e2ee86b223775947eb5e26c62291a45df2fdcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-css 的功能「恢复未保存草稿」：编辑中的草稿暂存于当前浏览器 localStorage，重新打开页面后可恢复；草稿与已提交样式分开，只有宿主确认的样式会应用到页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/controller.ts:77-96","src/client/index.ts:63-75"]}
